  "name": {
    "zh": "mos_打光",
    "en": "mos_rimlight"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "传统 2D 偏移边缘打光插件：通过镜像拼贴偏移遮罩提取受光边缘（杜绝画面边界穿帮），支持原图层曝光压暗、发光层之下叠加黑白渐变或四色渐变、边缘高光曝光提亮，以及高速独立发光开关。",
    "en": "Classic 2D offset rim light effect: extracts lit edges with a tiled offset alpha matte (preventing frame-edge leaks), base layer exposure, under-glow B&W or 4-color gradient overlay, rim exposure/tint, and fast padded glow switch."
  },
  "groups": {
    "遮罩与拼贴": { "zh": "遮罩与拼贴", "en": "Matte & Tiling" },
    "手动偏移": { "zh": "手动偏移", "en": "Manual Offset" },
    "原图层曝光": { "zh": "原图层曝光", "en": "Base Exposure" },
    "边缘光色彩": { "zh": "边缘光色彩", "en": "Rim Light Color" },
